wait add(int a
snap step-06b-completion
type d
wait add(int a
snap step-06c-completion-stays
wheel 10 40 down
snap step-06d-wheel-closes-completion
key ctrl+g
type :45:5
key enter
key alt+s
wait Doc line 1
